X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260708T160000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Cite it Right with NoodleTools: MLA + APA
DESCRIPTION:This workshop covers both MLA and APA style and will show you
  how to use this powerful application (FREE for SRJC students!) to build 
 correct citations\, format your bibliographies\, and use the integration 
 features with SRJC Research databases. This application also offers outli
 ning\, and paper-writing features\, including the capability to create pa
 pers via Google Docs.To learn more and register for the Zoom\, click here
 . (https://santarosa.libcal.com/calendar/workshops)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This workshop covers both MLA and APA s
 tyle and will show you how to use this powerful application (FREE for SRJ
 C students!) to build correct citations\, format your bibliographies\, an
 d use the integration features with SRJC Research databases. This applica
 tion also offers outlining\, and paper-writing features\, including the c
 apability to create papers via Google Docs.</p><p><a href="https://santar
 osa.libcal.com/calendar/workshops" target="_blank" rel="noopener">To lear
 n more and register for the Zoom\, click here.</a></p>
